<title>POLAND: LENTEX JULY NET RISES TO PLN 2.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>LENTEX JULY NET RISES TO PLN 2.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.40 vs   0.91</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.13 vs   1.72</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.61 vs   1.77</p>
<p> Sales		   14.92 vs  12.15</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.31 vs   4.41</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	12.35 vs   7.33</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.02 vs   7.29</p>
<p> Sales		   83.72 vs  73.37</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish floor coverings maker is Lentex</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
